# Text files are normalised to LF in the repository and checked out as LF, so a
# digest recorded on one platform matches the same file on another. The toolkit
# hashes its own sources (scripts/INTEGRITY.json), so a CRLF checkout would make
# an unmodified toolkit report as modified.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Altium libraries are byte-exact compound-file binaries, and the bundled
# template is read verbatim by the PCB writer. Never let Git apply end-of-line
# or text conversion to them: one substituted byte makes the container
# unreadable and the readback checker fail for a reason that is not in the JSON.
*.PcbLib binary
*.SchLib binary

# Other binary assets.
*.png binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
